# ---- The party board (com.ziggfreed.common.party.board): a player puts up a notice to find a party, and others read
# it and ask to join. Its page, how a notice reads, the lines a poster and an asker get, and the announcement everyone
# online reads when a poster ticks the box. A name is {0} unless a line says otherwise. ----
board.title = Party Board
board.lead = Put up a notice to find a party, or ask to join one. Nobody is moved for you: walk to the gate, and it shows where your party is.
board.section.dungeon = Notices for {0}
board.section.all = Notices
board.section.yours = Your notice
board.empty = No notices up right now. Put one up and others can find you.
